{"unit_id":"elonnzhang__dsh-system-prompt#card-zh","repo":"elonnzhang/dsh-system-prompt","commit":"233df00565375337f6c5dcd00c9002247b3e1c42","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-prompt 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的只读会话提示词检查插件。它通过会话检查 RPC 读取当前活动会话，并在对话视图增加“系统提示词”标签，也在轨迹详情中提供“组成部分”页签。界面可查看提示词分段、运行时上下文、变量、工具 Schema、注入消息及其全局、预设或 Agent 来源；用户可刷新或重试读取。适合需要了解某个会话实际组装了哪些提示词内容的开发者。插件依赖 Harness 的会话、连接和 Web UI 服务，不要求额外 API 密钥或外部账户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:40-50","src/host/index.ts:111-152"]}
{"unit_id":"elonnzhang__dsh-system-prompt#card-en","repo":"elonnzhang/dsh-system-prompt","commit":"233df00565375337f6c5dcd00c9002247b3e1c42","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-system-prompt is a read-only DeepSeek Harness web plugin for inspecting live session prompts. Its tabs show prompt sections, context, variables, tools, injected messages, and global, preset, or agent origins. Users can refresh or retry; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:40-50","src/host/index.ts:111-152"]}
